      intro x hx j hj
      rcases hR1_sub x hx with hx_buf | hx_fresh
      · exact hD1 x (List.mem_append_left _ hx_buf) j hj
      · rcases worldOwned_zero_or_allocated hWT1 j (worldTypedIvls_sub_worldOwned s1 S Nd j hj) with
