      · exact hMA_en.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.2.1 j (worldTypedIvls_sub_worldOwned entry S_en Nd_en j hj)
      · exact validBufList_disj validBufList_pmcBufs hMA_en.2.1 x hx_buf j hj
