      · dsimp only [s1, a16]; rw [hfr224_1]; exact h224
      · dsimp only [s1, a16]; rw [hfr224_1, hfr208_1]; exact hle
      · dsimp only [s1, a16]; rw [hfr208_1]; exact h8
